                                                    <Topic_Keyword>
                                                      <Keyword rdf:about="http://silkroads.eventpool.kr/resource/ODI">
                                                        <dc:description
                                                         rdf:datatype=
                                                        "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"
                                                        >The Open Data Initiative (ODI) is a collaborative effort between Microsoft, Adobe, and SAP to create a unified data model for customer data. The initiative aims to provide customers with a complete view of their customer data across different systems and platforms, by using a common data schema.&#xD;
&#xD;
The ODI data model is built on the Microsoft Common Data Model, which is an open-source data schema that defines a standard set of entities, attributes, and relationships for common business scenarios. The ODI extends this model with industry-specific entities and attributes to create a comprehensive data model for customer data.&#xD;
&#xD;
The ODI enables customers to easily integrate data from different sources, such as CRM systems, marketing automation platforms, and other enterprise applications, into a single view of their customer data. This can help organizations to gain a deeper understanding of their customers, improve customer engagement and satisfaction, and make more informed business decisions.&#xD;
&#xD;
The ODI is part of a broader trend towards open data and interoperability in the enterprise software industry. By providing a common data model, the ODI aims to make it easier for organizations to share and use data across different systems and platforms, and to promote greater collaboration and innovation in the development of enterprise applications.</dc:description>
                                                        <rdfs:label
                                                         rdf:datatype=
                                                        "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"
                                                        >ODI</rdfs:label>
                                                        <Keyword_Topic rdf:resource="http://silkroads.eventpool.kr/resource/Linked_Open_Data_운동_–ODI__open_Data_Institute_설명"/>
                                                        <skos:altLabel
                                                         rdf:datatype=
                                                        "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"
                                                        >Open Data Initiative</skos:altLabel>
                                                      </Keyword>
                                                    </Topic_Keyword>
                                                    <Topic_Keyword rdf:resource="http://silkroads.eventpool.kr/resource/데이터_개방"/>
                                                    <rdfs:label
                                                     rdf:datatype=
                                                    "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"
                                                    >Linked Open Data 운동 –ODI : open Data Institute 설명</rdfs:label>
                                                    <dc:description
                                                     rdf:datatype=
                                                    "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"
                                                    >ODI Open Data Institute가 10년간 전 세계 링크드 오픈 데이터를 개방하며 데이터 활성화를 추진하고 있으며, 이를 통해 현재 전 세계적으로 데이터가 개방 및 공유되는 활성화된 상태이다</dc:description>
                                                    <URL rdf:datatype=
                                                    "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"
                                                    >https://theodi.org/</URL>
                                                    <Topic_Keyword rdf:resource="http://silkroads.eventpool.kr/resource/팀버너스리"/>
                                                    <Topic_Keyword rdf:resource="http://silkroads.eventpool.kr/resource/데이터_공유"/>
